#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:78
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_ComingUpWithMealsIsHard"
msgid ""
"Oh, it's so hard every day…\p"
"What's hard?\n"
"You need to ask?\p"
"It's trying to figure out what to\n"
"make for meals every day.\p"
"It really isn't easy coming up with\n"
"meals every day.$"
msgstr ""
"唉，每天都好辛苦啊……\p"
"什么事辛苦？\n"
"这还用问吗？\p"
"就是每天都要想\n"
"饭菜该做什么。\p"
"每天都要想菜单，\n"
"真的一点都不容易。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:87
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_HelloDoYouKnowFunnyPhrase"
msgid ""
"Oh, hello!\n"
"Welcome to the PEPPER household.\p"
"I have a question for you.\n"
"Have you ever baby-sat?\p"
"You see, I'm a new father, so raising\n"
"a child is all new to me.\p"
"And I have a problem. My daughter\n"
"WALDA doesn't laugh enough.\p"
"I think she'd laugh for me if I told\n"
"her something funny.\p"
"Do you know of a funny word or\n"
"phrase you can tell me?$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你好！\n"
"欢迎来到佩珀家。\p"
"我想问你一个问题。\n"
"你带过小婴儿吗？\p"
"其实我刚当上爸爸，\n"
"养孩子的事我一点经验都没有。\p"
"我有个烦恼。\n"
"我的女儿瓦妲不太爱笑。\p"
"我想如果我跟她说些好玩的话，\n"
"她应该就会笑了。\p"
"你知道什么好玩的\n"
"词语或句子吗？$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:101
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_BeenSayingXDoYouKnowBetterPhrase"
msgid ""
"I've been saying “{STR_VAR_1}”\n"
"to amuse her lately.\p"
"Do you know of a better word or\n"
"a phrase that might work?$"
msgstr ""
"最近我一直跟她说\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”来逗她。\p"
"你知道有什么更好的\n"
"词语或句子吗？$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:107
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_WonderfulLetsHearSuggestion"
msgid ""
"Oh, that's wonderful.\n"
"So, let's hear it, your suggestion.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，太好了。\n"
"那么，说来听听吧。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:111
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_OhIsThatRight"
msgid ""
"Oh, is that right?\p"
"Well, if you come up with a good\n"
"suggestion, I'm all ears.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，是吗？\p"
"如果你想到了好点子，\n"
"我随时洗耳恭听。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:116
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_LetsGiveItATry2"
msgid ""
"Ah, I see.\n"
"Well, let's give it a try, shall we?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，原来如此。\n"
"那么，我们来试试看吧？$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:120
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_OhShesLaughing"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Oh, yes! She's laughing!\n"
"Oh, I am as delighted as she!$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"哦，太好了！她笑了！\n"
"我和她一样开心！$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:126
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_LetsGiveItATry"
msgid ""
"Ah, I see.\n"
"Well, let's give it a try, shall we?$"
msgstr ""
"啊，原来如此。\n"
"那么，我们来试试看吧？$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:130
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_ShesNotSmilingAtAll"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Hmmm… She's not smiling at all.\n"
"Maybe WALDA is one serious child…$"
msgstr ""
"{STR_VAR_1}。\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}。\p"
"嗯……她完全没有笑。\n"
"难道瓦妲是个很严肃的孩子……$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:136
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_ThinkOfMyOwnPhrase"
msgid ""
"Oh, so you don't know any good words.\n"
"I'd better think for myself, then.\p"
"Hmm…\n"
"How about “{STR_VAR_1}”?\l"
"Let's see if that will work.$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你不知道什么好词啊。\n"
"那我只好自己想了。\p"
"嗯……\n"
"“{STR_VAR_1}”怎么样？\l"
"来试试看有没有用吧。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:143
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_ShesNotSmilingAtAll2"
msgid ""
"{STR_VAR_1}.\n"
"{STR_VAR_1}.\p"
"Hmmm… She's not smiling at all.\n"
