#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:149
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_OhYouDontKnowAny"
msgid ""
"Oh, so you don't know any good words.\n"
"I guess I'll try to amuse her with\l"
"the saying I used before.\p"
"Anyways, if you have a good suggestion,\n"
"don't hesitate in telling me, okay?$"
msgstr ""
"哦，你不知道什么好词啊。\n"
"那我就继续用以前那句话\l"
"来逗她吧。\p"
"总之，要是你想到了好点子，\n"
"随时都可以告诉我哦。$"

#: data/maps/RustboroCity_Flat1_2F/scripts.inc:156
msgctxt "RustboroCity_Flat1_2F_Text_ThankYouIllGiveYouWallpaper"
msgid ""
"Thank you!\p"
"Thanks to you, my darling WALDA\n"
"laughed for me!\p"
"Actually, I may not look all that\n"
"special, but I'm one of DEVON\l"
"CORPORATION's top researchers.\p"
"So, how about I do something in return\n"
"for you?\p"
"I know, I'll add some new wallpaper\n"
"patterns for the BOXES in the PC\l"
"POKéMON Storage System.\p"
"In the wallpaper pattern menu,\n"
"select “FRIENDS.”\p"
"That will give you access to the new\n"
"wallpaper patterns.$"
msgstr ""
"谢谢你！\p"
"多亏了你，\n"
"我亲爱的瓦妲对我笑了！\p"
"其实别看我这样，\n"
"我可是得文股份有限公司\l"
"顶尖的研究员之一。\p"
"那么，就让我来\n"
"回报你一下吧。\p"
"对了，我来给电脑里宝可梦\n"
"寄放系统的盒子\l"
"加几种新的壁纸吧。\p"
"在壁纸的菜单里\n"
"选择“朋友”。\p"
"这样就能使用新的壁纸了。$"

